      "mutation_intent": "Keep geometry and actors effectively unchanged so the planner still has a clear path, but mildly adjust surface conditions without introducing strong external blockers. This should preserve the pattern where, despite valid sensing and stable final waypoints, target_speed and accel_cmd stay at zero with brakes applied and ego remains stationary for an extended period.",
